    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "An extreme weather event, characterized as one of the heaviest rainy seasons in three decades, overwhelmed the Euphrates river system. Verified hydrological mechanisms, including dam operations and seasonal rains, pushed water past protective embankments. The resulting flooding event led to documented damage to civilian infrastructure across Deir Ezzor and Raqqa, and unverified reports indicate several children may have drowned. The head of state subsequently conducted a fact-finding visit to the disaster area.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Sage",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0",
          "result-1",
          "result-5"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.78
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Precise data indicated reservoirs exceeded 97% capacity, a critical infrastructure problem. This water storage saturation, combined with record-level precipitation, caused widespread flooding. The disaster impact included the collapse of an earthen bridge, a structurally verified failure point. In response, a verified rescue operation was mounted as naval forces deployed boats for evacuations, documenting the emergency response.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Sage",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "how-4"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Following the documented inundation of populated areas, which included preventable destruction, transboundary cooperation was documented. The upstream dam operator, a riparian state, agreed to an upstream water management agreement to reduce releases. This data-driven interstate cooperation represents a cooperative arrangement for flood mitigation, though it came after-the-fact. The presidential visit to the disaster zone offered a symbolic gesture for political action.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Sage",
        "fragments": [
          "how-2",
